{"term": {"label": "心", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 6, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "作", "id": "作"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "失", "id": "失"}, {"form": "心", "variants": [], "id": "心"}, {"form": "敺", "id": "敺"}, {"form": "暴", "id": "暴"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "治", "id": "治"}, {"form": "竭", "id": "竭"}, {"form": "老", "id": "老"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "興", "id": "興"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "賊", "id": "賊"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}, {"form": "養", "id": "養"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.5965203448708737, "source": "心", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.5950491749820008, "source": "心", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 3.5409593240373143, "source": "心", "target": "竭"}, {"weight": 1.9315214116032138, "source": "心", "target": "失"}, {"weight": 1.749199854809259, "source": "心", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 0.49643688631389105, "source": "心", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 0.9760099665757773, "source": "心", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 1.461517782357478, "source": "興", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 3.253277251585533, "source": "興", "target": "賊"}, {"weight": 3.5409593240373143, "source": "興", "target": "作"}, {"weight": 2.6936614636501104, "source": "興", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 2.2192034840549946, "source": "親", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.27329333499968134, "source": "親", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.7083778602890038, "source": "親", "target": "失"}, {"weight": 1.3719056236677911, "source": "親", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 0.8329091229351039, "source": "親", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 2.98134353610